{"id": "1546714373182062722", "channel_id": "1543760297637187614", "author_id": "735868665706315856", "author_name": "duskisnotdust", "content": "I can’t find something to say that no one has said yet, but I genuinely think the old d-tide was one of the best endgames in any gacha I have played\nIt encourages clever resource management and teambuilding to scrape together 10 clears if possible, I brought Morimens up in any discussion about gacha endgames as an example of good game design\nThe changes just turned it on its head, each run is so obscenely long that it’s not even fun anymore, I no longer feel any desire to pull or build characters because this just looks exactly like every predatory endgame mode I’ve seen before \nreverting the changes and add an A6 or something, anything but this absolute unbalanced untested shitshow", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T02:50:43.130000+00:00", "thread_id": "1543760297637187614", "reactions": [{"emoji": "Saya_cry", "emoji_id": "1513123577384271963", "count": 8}, {"emoji": "Celeste_agree", "emoji_id": "1400771815076528258", "count": 2}], "thread_title": "D-tide Discussion", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1542484945447026708", "1542479601241030726"]}
